Error [E0105]: Dot call `.render()` conflicts with a method on `Box`
  --> tests/ui/root_call_collision.jet:15:9
    |
 15 |     box.render()
    |         ^^^^^^
 Why: A `#Root` function cannot silently compete with a real instance method
 Fix: Rename the `#Root` function or call it as `render(value, …)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0105
